# DEEP 10-25: the missing miner's letter, by the strongbox (read after the blast: the pages counts stay as they were)
place Note_Paper davynote at 1.8 -33.2 ground drop yaw=160
place Zone_Atmosphere halldark at 0 -20 y=5
place Zone_Sound hallsound at 0 -20 y=3
